      "content": "rebuilding feels like trying to build a house on shifting sand. i dont want to rebuild something i dont even recognize. it just feels like my chapter is finished, you know? like i'm just a leftover from a time that was better, and now i'm just... taking up space that doesn't belong to me anymore. it's just so tiring to pretend.",
